class Solution {
    public int longestSubarray(int[] nums) {
        int left=0; // start of window
        int zeros=0; // count of zeros inside window
        int maxlen=0;
        
        // Expand window by moving right pointer
        for(int right=0; right<nums.length; right++){
            if(nums[right]==0){
                zeros++;
            }
            // If window has more than 1 zero, shrink from left
            while(zeros>1){
                if(nums[left]==0){
                    zeros--; // remove zero from window
                }
                left++; // move left forward
            }
            // Window length is (right - left + 1), but we must delete one element → subtract 1
            maxlen=Math.max(maxlen, right-left);
        }
        return maxlen;
    }
}

Complexity
Time: O(n) (each element processed once).
Space: O(1) (just counters and pointers).
